# Repository Structure

## Purpose

Documents the **current canonical** layout. Do not refactor toward a staged migration tree without an explicit task.

## Current canonical layout

Production code uses **flat domain packages**, not layered ceremony subtrees.

| Package | Role |
| :--- | :--- |
| `internal/controlplane/` | Admin API composition root: `Service`, outbox workers, billing, fraud admin, wiring (~shrinking) |
| `internal/reports/` | Report catalog, ClickHouse query handlers, export hooks, fraud scrub |
| `internal/reportjob/` | Async report jobs, schedules, PG runner, validation-job HTTP |
| `internal/fraudadmin/` | Fraud admin HTTP routes, DTOs, validators, integrations reader, policy presets (`/api/v1/fraud/*`). Files omit package-name prefix (`handlers.go`, `integrations.go`, `presets.go`) — `naming.mdc` |
| `internal/billingadmin/` | Billing HTTP routes, composite reads, workspace export (`/api/v1/billing/*`). Files omit package-name prefix (`handlers.go`) — `naming.mdc` |
| `internal/opsadmin/` | Ops HTTP routes, `Reader` (`ManagementOpsReader`), stack health DTOs, fan-out helpers (`/api/v1/ops/*`, audit export, RUM). Files omit package-name prefix (`handlers.go`, `reader_*.go`) — `naming.mdc` |
| `internal/campaign/` | Campaign DTOs, HTTP handlers, `Runtime`, `WizardStore`, editor/migration routes, integration health builder, pure validators. Files omit `campaign_` prefix (`dto.go`, `editor_handlers.go`) — `naming.mdc` |
| `internal/flow/` | Flow/lander/offer DTOs, path validation, HTTP handlers (`/api/v1/flows`, hosted lander routes). Files omit `flow_` prefix (`handlers.go`, `validate.go`) — `naming.mdc` |
| `internal/brand/` | Brand/creative DTOs, HTTP handlers (`/api/v1/brands`, `/api/v1/brand-creatives/*`). Files omit `brand_` prefix (`handlers.go`, `store.go`) — `naming.mdc` |
| `internal/supply/` | Sellers/ads.txt DTOs, chain validation, HTTP handlers (`/api/v1/supply/*`). Files omit package-name prefix (`handlers.go`, `store.go`) — `naming.mdc` |
| `internal/smartalerts/` | Smart alert rules CRUD, worker tick, drain-stuck check (`/api/v1/smart-alerts/*`). Files omit package-name prefix (`store.go`, `handlers.go`, `worker_batch.go`) — `naming.mdc` |
| `internal/governance/` | Quota manager, quota repair outbox applier, media-buyer spend-cap checks. Team RBAC/budget approval stays in `controlplane/team_*.go` |
| `internal/reconciliation/` | Recon window, budget snapshot, global spend sync, adjust applier, runs list, RTB CH stats. Depends on `governance` for quota repair tick |
| `internal/ingestion/` | Hot path: gnet, filters, stream, track, registry glue |
| `internal/control/` | Monolith runner for `cmd/control` |
| `internal/fraud/` | ML scoring (cold path only) |
| `internal/domain/` | Shared hot-path types, sharding, budget invariants |
| `internal/<svc>/` | Side domains: `payment/`, `ledger/`, `notify/`, `identity/`, `edge/`, `rtb/`, `openrtb/` |

Module: `ad-event-processor`. `cmd/<binary>/main.go` wires config only - no business logic in `main`.

## Modular monolith and bridges

Deployment: **one** `cmd/control` process; domain folders are compile-time modules, not separate services (`modular-monolith.mdc`, `boundaries.mdc`).

| Concept | Meaning |
| :--- | :--- |
| Composition root | `internal/controlplane/` — wires routes, workers, outbox; **shrinking** |
| Bridge | `*_bridge.go` in controlplane only — `Service` implements domain `Host` / `Effects`; **no business logic** |
| Adapter | `*_admin_adapter.go` — registration and error mapping |
| God package | **Forbidden** — see ceilings below |

Bridges are **in-process DI** inside the modular monolith, not network adapters between deployables.

### controlplane vs sibling domains

| Surface | Lives in | Notes |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `*Service` methods (`PatchCampaign`, `PublishCampaign`, …) | `controlplane` | Postgres/Redis side effects |
| `CampaignsHTTPHandlers`, report HTTP | `campaign`, `reports`, `reportjob` | Injected callbacks; registered from `adminapi_wire.go` |
| `FraudHTTPHandlers`, billing HTTP, ops HTTP, flow/brand/supply HTTP | `fraudadmin`, `billingadmin`, `opsadmin`, `flow`, `brand`, `supply` | Service adapters in `*_bridge.go` / `*_admin_adapter.go` |
| Type aliases at boundary | `controlplane/campaign_aliases.go`, `flow_aliases.go`, `brand_aliases.go`, `supply_aliases.go`, `reports_aliases.go`, `reconciliation_aliases.go`, … | Backward compat for flat package call sites |
| Scope/auth bridges | `controlplane/campaign_bridge.go`, `campaign_runtime_bridge.go` | Re-exports campaign helpers; `Service` implements `campaign.Effects` |
| Campaign runtime | `campaign.Runtime` | CRUD, create, templates, patch, publish gate, pause/resume, stats (PG+CH), pacing, schedule, status history, events, import/export via `ImportExportHost`, clone/migration via `Effects` |
| Campaign worker | `campaign.Worker` + `DeliveryHost` | `ProcessScheduleTick`, `RunDeliveryOptimizerTick`, `RunAutoscaleBudgetTick`, `ClosedLoopPacingController`; autoscale/MAB in `campaign/*_tx.go`; flow bandit in `flow/bandit_tx.go`; `Service` implements `DeliveryHost` in `campaign_delivery_bridge.go` |
| Campaign wizard | `campaign.WizardStore` + `WizardHost` | Session PG in `wizard_store.go`; `Service` implements host in `campaign_wizard_bridge.go` |
| Flow admin | `flow.HTTPHandlers` + `flow.Service` | PG CRUD on `*Service`; path shape in `flow/validate.go` |
| Brand/supply admin | `brand.HTTPHandlers`, `supply.HTTPHandlers` | PG on `*Service`; adapters in `brand_admin_adapter.go`, `supply_admin_adapter.go` |
| Smart alerts | `smartalerts.Store`, `smartalerts.HTTPHandlers`, worker | `smartalerts_bridge.go`; `Service` implements `smartalerts.Host` |
| Governance / quota | `governance.QuotaManager`, `QuotaRepairRunner`, spend-cap | `governance_bridge.go`; team approval in `team_budget_approval.go` |
| Reconciliation | `reconciliation.ReconWorker`, `ReconService`, `GlobalSpendReconciler` | `governance_bridge.go` + `reconciliation_aliases.go`; `Service` implements `reconciliation.Host` |

`service_campaign.go` remains in controlplane for brand PG hooks, campaign supply chain, and experiment cohorts.

| Ops reader | `opsadmin.Reader` + `ReaderDeps` | `NewManagementOpsReader(svc)` in `ops_reader_bridge.go`; `OpsAlerter`/metric scraper stay in controlplane |

## Allowed vs banned subtrees

| Allowed subdirs | Banned ceremony |
| :--- | :--- |
| `db/`, `queries/`, `migrations/`, `pb/` | `dto/`, `usecase/`, `providers/`, `repositories/` |
| `controlplane/authz/`, `controlplane/outboxpb/` | Generic `services/` subtrees |

Root clutter: `core.mdc` Sources-only repository.

